WEBVTT

00:06:30.411 --> 00:06:34.284
Our optimism cannot
be a sunny day attitude.

00:06:34.308 --> 00:06:37.619
It has to be gritty,
determined, relentless.

00:06:37.643 --> 00:06:41.423
It is a choice we have to make
every single day.

00:06:41.891 --> 00:06:46.383
Every barrier must be an indication
to try a different way.

00:06:46.407 --> 00:06:48.705
In radical collaboration with each other,

00:06:48.729 --> 00:06:51.148
we can do this.

00:06:51.172 --> 00:06:53.760
For years, I had a recurring nightmare

00:06:53.784 --> 00:06:58.691
in which I saw seven pairs
of children's eyes,

00:06:58.715 --> 00:07:01.211
the eyes of seven generations,